explain.ja:
両端が 2 乗の形か見る: x² の係数 {=co(expr)[0]} = ({=sqrt(co(expr)[0])})²、定数項の大きさ {=abs(co(expr)[2])} = ({=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))})² → a = {=(sqrt(co(expr)[0]) === 1 ? '' : sqrt(co(expr)[0])) + 'x'}、b = {=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))}
x の係数は {=co(expr)[1]}。0(x の項がない)で「2 乗 − 2 乗」なら a² − b² = (a + b)(a − b)。2ab = 2 × {=sqrt(co(expr)[0])} × {=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))} = {=2*sqrt(co(expr)[0])*sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))} と同じ大きさなら a² ± 2ab + b² = (a ± b)²(符号は x の係数に合わせる)
当てはめて {answer}

explain.ko:
양 끝이 제곱 꼴인지 봅니다: x² 의 계수 {=co(expr)[0]} = ({=sqrt(co(expr)[0])})², 상수항의 크기 {=abs(co(expr)[2])} = ({=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))})² → a = {=(sqrt(co(expr)[0]) === 1 ? '' : sqrt(co(expr)[0])) + 'x'}, b = {=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))}
x 의 계수는 {=co(expr)[1]}. 0 (x 의 항이 없음)이고 "제곱 − 제곱"이면 a² − b² = (a + b)(a − b). 2ab = 2 × {=sqrt(co(expr)[0])} × {=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))} = {=2*sqrt(co(expr)[0])*sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))} 와 크기가 같으면 a² ± 2ab + b² = (a ± b)² (부호는 x 의 계수를 따릅니다)
맞춰 넣으면 {answer}

explain.en:
Check that both ends are squares: the x² coefficient {=co(expr)[0]} = ({=sqrt(co(expr)[0])})² and the size of the constant {=abs(co(expr)[2])} = ({=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))})² → a = {=(sqrt(co(expr)[0]) === 1 ? '' : sqrt(co(expr)[0])) + 'x'}, b = {=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))}
The x coefficient is {=co(expr)[1]}. If it is 0 (no x term) and the form is "square − square", use a² − b² = (a + b)(a − b). If it matches 2ab = 2 × {=sqrt(co(expr)[0])} × {=sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))} = {=2*sqrt(co(expr)[0])*sqrt(abs(co(expr)[2]))} in size, use a² ± 2ab + b² = (a ± b)² (the sign follows the x coefficient)
Applying it: {answer}

